<%#
patra-final 5b (G58): override of administrate's string form partial.
autocomplete=off keeps the browser from dropping the admin's saved email
into the Name field on the New User form (it pattern-matched the form as
a login form). Applies to all super-admin string inputs — harmless there.
%>

<div class="field-unit__label">
  <%= f.label field.attribute %>
</div>
<div class="field-unit__field">
  <%= f.text_field field.attribute, autocomplete: 'off' %>
</div>
